{
  "name": "argo-search",
  "version": "2.9.1",
  "description": "Argo 阿尔戈 — 统一搜索与证据核验。推荐 npx -y github:taxueseek/argo 或 install.sh 安装（不依赖 npm 发版）。多语言路由、261 个源（226 个免密钥开箱可用）、影视/体育/金融等垂直源、19 个 MCP 工具（与 CLI 能力面对齐）。",
  "keywords": [
    "mcp",
    "mcp-server",
    "search",
    "web-search",
    "research",
    "ai-agent",
    "claude",
    "grok",
    "kimi",
    "codex",
    "argo",
    "npx"
  ],
  "private": true,
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Argo Search",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/taxueseek/argo.git"
  },
  "bin": {
    "argo-search": "bin/argo.js"
  },
  "files": [
